  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Lassaigne's test is used for the detection of nitrogen and given by all nitrogenous compound except diazo <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/IxsYbGiNtk7XKcRSICE6DdYRaf-4vqT6ntN7cJtLlDA.original.fullsize.png\"><br> compounds.\nThis test is shown only by the compounds containing $\\mathrm{C}$ and $\\mathrm{N}$ both hence hydroxyl amine hydrochloride $\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{NOH} . \\mathrm{HCl}\\right)$ will not perform this test.",
    "image": null
